      "content_sha256": "e1a9f7bb361c9e08dd35def0bf44d35b09a0f187348e20400498f1dba70933dc"
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "where $ \\alpha_{ir} $ and $ \\mu_{G} $ respectively denote the additive effect of allele i and the mean phenotype in the noninbred population. If gene action is additive, then $ G_{ii} - \\mu_{G} = $",
      "source_page": 93,
      "printed_page": 73,
      "source_block_ids": [
        "Genetics_chapter4:p027:b19"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        30.0,
